Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:52.02,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Rain rain come wash away the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:55.44,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}With demons in my head
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:21:01.07,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Vengeance is the only way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.49,0:21:14.87,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}We had love before the end
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:17.71,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}We had trust, belief and friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.71,0:21:19.54,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Maybe something more
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:22.46,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,720)\blur2\fax-0.1}Maybe something less
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:26.26,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}This is how I make amends
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.26,0:21:29.18,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}For the light I turn to darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:32.85,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Shedding blood until it’s done
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.69,0:21:42.44,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}There’s no other way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:45.11,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}To end this pain and sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.11,0:21:48.28,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to that place
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.28,0:21:50.87,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:53.99,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}How could I ever forgive
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.99,0:21:56.70,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}When I cannot forget
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:21:59.58,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to that place
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.87,0:22:02.29,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.68,0:22:12.05,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}I’ll make you beg
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.05,0:22:15.10,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Make you pray
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:16.98,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Until your heart stops
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.98,0:22:17.89,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Until your heart stops
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.89,0:22:20.98,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}You’ll be wishing you were dead
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.98,0:22:23.69,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Because an eye or a tooth
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.69,0:22:26.28,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Won’t be all that you lose
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:32.16,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}I’ll make you pay for what you did
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:38.79,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}For what you did
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:45.34,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}There’s no other way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:48.46,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}To end this pain and sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.84,0:22:51.26,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to that place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.59,0:22:54.14,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.68,0:20:52.02,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}雨 雨沖洗掉這痛苦
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.02,0:20:55.44,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}被惡魔支配一般
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.44,0:21:01.07,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}只有選擇復仇
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.49,0:21:14.87,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}結束之前我們曾擁有愛
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.87,0:21:17.71,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}曾擁有信任 擁有信仰與友情
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.71,0:21:19.54,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}或許在此之上
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.54,0:21:22.46,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,720)\blur2\fax-0.1}或許在此之下
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.46,0:21:26.26,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}這就是我的改過
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.26,0:21:29.18,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}追尋光明我投向黑暗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.18,0:21:32.85,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}浴血戰鬥至最後一刻
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.69,0:21:42.44,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}我別無選擇
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.44,0:21:45.11,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}為了告別這痛苦與悲傷
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.11,0:21:48.28,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}帶我去那邊
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.28,0:21:50.87,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}帶我去明天
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.24,0:21:53.99,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}我如何原諒
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.99,0:21:56.70,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}如果我不能忘記
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.04,0:21:59.58,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}帶我去那邊
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.87,0:22:02.29,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}帶我去明天
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.68,0:22:12.05,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}我會讓你乞求
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.05,0:22:15.10,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}讓你祈禱
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.52,0:22:16.98,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}直至心臟停止
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.98,0:22:17.89,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}直至心臟停止
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.89,0:22:20.98,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}你將會求死不得
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.98,0:22:23.69,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}因為以牙還牙
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.69,0:22:26.28,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}不過只是開始而已
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.28,0:22:32.16,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}終究會讓你血債血償
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.58,0:22:38.79,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}付出代價
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.04,0:22:45.34,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}我別無選擇
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.92,0:22:48.46,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}為了告別這痛苦與悲傷
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.84,0:22:51.26,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}帶我去那邊
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.59,0:22:54.14,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}帶我去明天
